    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0000_system_01a",
      "hash64": "E5926B1F93F15D72",
      "text": "私立橘子學院",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0000_system_01b",
      "hash64": "E5926A1F93F15BBF",
      "text": "私立葡萄學院",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0000_system_02a",
      "hash64": "E595931F93F3D741",
      "text": "師從傳統，茁壯成長。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0000_system_02b",
      "hash64": "E595901F93F3D228",
      "text": "尊重個性，開拓未來。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0000_system_03",
      "hash64": "3D3365D649E7430D",
      "text": "來吧！歡迎您也來到\\n寶可夢的世界！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0000_system_04a",
      "hash64": "E5816F1F93E2F10B",
      "text": "橘子學院\\n校長克拉韋爾",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0000_system_04b",
      "hash64": "E581701F93E2F2BE",
      "text": "葡萄學院\\n校長克拉韋爾",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0000_system_05",
      "hash64": "3D335FD649E738DB",
      "text": "帕底亞地區是一片自然豐富，\\n土地豐饒的大地。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0000_system_06",
      "hash64": "3D3360D649E73A8E",
      "text": "這裡棲息著許多\\n被稱為「寶可夢」的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0000_system_06_2",
      "hash64": "EFA74DA854D19FE3",
      "text": "不可思議的生物。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0000_system_07",
      "hash64": "3D3361D649E73C41",
      "text": "大海、天空、城鎮之中……\\n處處都是寶可夢們所居住的地方。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0000_system_08",
      "hash64": "3D335AD649E7305C",
      "text": "我們人類會與牠們互相幫助，\\n生活在一起。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0000_system_09a",
      "hash64": "E5777B1F93DAB0EA",
      "text": "在橘子學院，\\n為了從各方面更深入了解寶可夢，",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0000_system_09b",
      "hash64": "E5777A1F93DAAF37",
      "text": "在葡萄學院，\\n為了從各方面更深入了解寶可夢，",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0000_system_10",
      "hash64": "3D3668D649E97DFD",
      "text": "有來自各個地區的人聚集在此，\\n互相學習，切磋琢磨，",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0000_system_11",
      "hash64": "3D3667D649E97C4A",
      "text": "作為寶可夢訓練家\\n讓寶可夢對戰，與寶可夢成長。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "common_0000_system_12",
      "hash64": "3D3666D649E97A97",
      "text": "我們將透過多彩多姿的課程\\n激發出學生的未知潛力。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "common_0000_system_13",
      "hash64": "3D3665D649E978E4",
      "text": "這裡是能夠遇見夥伴、寶可夢，\\n並且發現嶄新自己的地方……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "common_0000_system_14a",
      "hash64": "ECE4A81F97B5BCF0",
      "text": "橘子學院，\\n誠摯期待您的入學。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "common_0000_system_14b",
      "hash64": "ECE4AB1F97B5C209",
      "text": "葡萄學院，\\n誠摯期待您的入學。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
